is available in a web app and on WhatsApp. The Individual tier for scouts, analysts, coaches and board members starts at 20 EUR per seat per month with credit-based pricing; higher tiers add more usage, customization and Decision Scientist support. There are also courses, a community and the Twelve Day conference.', 'AI-відповіді про гравців і команди
